Element-Wise Matrix Operations

Aim:-

1.To perform addition, subtraction, and multiplication of two Breeze matrices
2.verify the results programmatically.

Program (Scala):- 

import breeze.linalg._

object Main {
  def main(args: Array[String]): Unit = {

    val matrixA = DenseMatrix(
      (5, 9),
      (8, 2)
    )

    val matrixB = DenseMatrix(
      (9, 4),
      (5, 7)
    )

    val addition = matrixA + matrixB
    val subtraction = matrixA - matrixB
    val multiplication = matrixA * matrixB

    println("Addition")
    println(addition)

    println("Subtraction")
    println(subtraction)

    println("Multiplication")
    println(multiplication)
  }
}
